# OneTronix Core Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for full project context.

## Stack
Expo 53 + Expo Router + TypeScript + NativeWind + Redux Toolkit/RTK Query + Formik/Yup + MMKV persist.

## Structure
- `app/` = thin route shells only
- `src/components/steps/` = multi-step screen UI
- `src/components/globals/` = reusable UI + co-located `types.ts`
- `store/api/` = RTK Query endpoints; `store/types/` = API types

## Must Do
- Use path aliases (`@src`, `@globals`, `@store`, `@hooks`, `@utils`, `@assets`) — no cross-folder relative imports
- Use `useAppDispatch` / `useAppSelector` from `@src/hooks/useReduxHooks`
- Arrow function components; default export for screens/components
- Responsive sizing via `hs()`, `vs()`, `ms()` from `@utils/design/design`
- Toast errors/success via `renderToastError` / `renderToastSuccess` from `@src/hooks/useToasty`
- Match existing code style; minimize diff scope

## Must Not
- Add commits unless explicitly requested
- Put heavy UI logic in `app/` route files
- Introduce new state management libraries
- Commit secrets or `.env` files
